### TokenFactory SIWE Backend - API Requests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### ========================================
### Authentication Endpoints
### ========================================

### Get Nonce (Optional - can be generated client-side)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/nonce

### Login with SIWE
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "localhost:5173 wants you to sign in with your Ethereum account:\n0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890\n\nSign in to TokenFactory dApp\n\nURI: http://localhost:5173\nVersion: 1\nChain ID: 11155111\nNonce: abc123xyz\nIssued At: 2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "signature": "0x..."
}

### Verify Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### Profile Endpoints
### ========================================

### Get Profile by Address (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890

### Get Own Profile (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "Alice",
  "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1?v=4"
}

### Upload Avatar (Base64)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dataUrl": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
}

### Delete Avatar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/profile/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
